{:manifest/set :shop-frames
 :manifest/v1-commit "f3354a4"
 :manifest/note "Faustus shop calibration crops (grid, price overlay short/mid/long) and shop templates from v1 (diag/ excluded; full-desktop 7280x2160 dumps excluded: they capture the owner's whole desktop, not only the game). frames/ and labels/ are the owner's v2 shop 2 gate captures, 2026-11-24: screen-sized (3440x1440), black outside the captured region. pointer-row-N: the shop tab-list pointer strip with row N selected. grid-maps and grid-armour: the Merchant panel's grid region, mouse off the grid."
 :manifest/roles
 {:frame/raw "Recorded game screen frame or crop (PNG), input to a vision stage."
  :ref/template "Reference image a matcher compares against (item-art ref or template)."
  :label/ground-truth "EDN label from the owner's gate notes. pointers.edn: {\"frames/<file>\" row}. grids.edn: {\"frames/<file>\" {:size [w h] :occupied #{[col row]} :targets [[col row]]}}."}
 :manifest/files
